# Pre-Commit & Push Quality Gates

**Never `git commit` or `git push` until local checks pass.** Hooks will reject bad commits; do not use `--no-verify`.

## Before every commit

Run on changed source files (or full project if unsure):

```bash
npm run types
npm run lint
```

Optional but safe before large commits: `npm test`

### Staged-file limits (`.husky/pre-commit`)

| Check | Rule |
|-------|------|
| **Line count** | Every staged `*.{js,jsx,ts,tsx,css,scss,html}` file ≤ **300 lines**. Split large files before staging. |
| **Prettier** | Hook auto-formats staged files — run `npm run format` on touched files to avoid surprise re-stages. |
| **ESLint** | Hook runs `eslint --fix` on staged `*.{js,jsx,ts,tsx}` — **errors block commit** (warnings usually pass). |
| **TypeScript** | `npm run types` runs when any staged source under `src/` or `e2e/` changes. |

## Commit message format (`.husky/commit-msg`) — REQUIRED

First line **must** match (project from `.env.share`, default `ACCT`):

```
<type>/<PROJECT>-<number>/<PROJECT>-<number>/<description>
```

- **Types:** `feature`, `hotfix`, `bugfix`, `chore`, `refactor`, `docs`, `test`, `ci`, `perf`, `style`
- **Numbers:** digits only (`[0-9]+`) — use `0` when no Jira ticket: `ACCT-0/ACCT-0`
- **Description:** non-empty text after the third `/`

```
✅ feature/ACCT-0/ACCT-0/Add Zustand app shell state and simplify routing.
❌ Add Zustand app shell state and simplify routing.
❌ feat: add zustand
```

Use HEREDOC for multi-line messages; **first line** must still match the regex.

## Before every push (`.husky/pre-push`)

When pushed commits touch source, hook runs:

1. `npm run build`
2. Playwright a11y e2e (only if relevant paths changed)
3. `npm run lighthouse`

Before pushing, run at minimum:

```bash
npm run types && npm run lint && npm run build
```

## Agent commit workflow

1. Finish code changes.
2. Run `npm run types` and `npm run lint` — fix **errors** first.
3. Confirm no staged/new file exceeds 300 lines.
4. Draft commit message in **Jira format** before `git commit`.
5. `git add` → `git commit` → if hook auto-formats, verify `git status` is clean (amend only per git-safety rules).
6. Before `git push`, run `npm run build` (or `npm run quality` if time allows).
